    "source_sha256": "d981f37ee190975bc9dcc1fa4003a98d4afdd98eff272f3d2c7c282edc036502",
    "target": "你与格蕾丝共度的时光——你经历的那些冒险——都将消失。",
    "existing_id": "p10523-3851e9cbf38b",
